<title>UK: BOXING-BRITAIN'S HAMED RETAINS WBO AND IBF TITLES.</title>
<headline>BOXING-BRITAIN'S HAMED RETAINS WBO AND IBF TITLES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's &quot;Prince&quot; Naseem Hamed stopped Argentina's Juan Cabrera in the second round on Saturday to retain his WBO and IBF featherweight boxing titles.</p>
</text>
